3194139534744 true] [17592186307162 1145 "Let's check our continuity conditions:\n\n- $g(4)=13$ exists$\\,\\,✓$\n\n- The left and right-sided limits are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,{4}^{-}}g(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,{4}^{-}}3x=12, \\\\ {lim}_{x\\to \\,{4}^{+}}g(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,{4}^{+}}3x=12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the left and right-sided limits are equal, we conclude that statement I is true and\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 4}g(x)=12.\\,\\,✓\n$$\n\n- The value of the limit is ${lim}_{x\\to 4}g(x)=12,$ while the value of the function is $g(4)=13.$ So, statement II is false and\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 4}g(x)\\ne g(4)\\,\\,\\times \n$$\n\nSince the third condition failed, the function has a removable discontinuity at $x=4,$ and statement III is true.\n\nIn conclusion, only statements I and III are true." 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307164 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307165 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307166 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307167 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307168 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1041 "selection" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307164 13194139534744 true] [17592186307163 1110 #uuid "528c1cd4-5920-56e4-a2e9-82178e232930" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307164 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307164 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534744 true] [17592186307164 1111 #uuid "13eb3e3b-398e-5705-8b37-faf0d0221d07" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307165 1034 "I only" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307165 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534744 true] [17592186307165 1111 #uuid "ffbf2054-544b-55d2-825d-51d4b8e04592" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307166 1034 "III only" 13194139534744 true] [17592186307166 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534744 true] [17592186307166 1111 #